    <text:outline-style style:name="Outline"><text:outline-level-style text:level="1" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="0.762cm" fo:text-indent="-0.762cm" fo:margin-left="0.762cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="2" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="1.016cm" fo:text-indent="-1.016cm" fo:margin-left="1.016cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="3" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="1.270cm" fo:text-indent="-1.270cm" fo:margin-left="1.270cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="4" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="1.524cm" fo:text-indent="-1.524cm" fo:margin-left="1.524cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="5" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="1.778cm" fo:text-indent="-1.778cm" fo:margin-left="1.778cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="6" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="2.032cm" fo:text-indent="-2.032cm" fo:margin-left="2.032cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="7" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="2.286cm" fo:text-indent="-2.286cm" fo:margin-left="2.286cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="8" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="2.540cm" fo:text-indent="-2.540cm" fo:margin-left="2.540cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="9" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="2.794cm" fo:text-indent="-2.794cm" fo:margin-left="2.794cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style><text:outline-level-style text:level="10" style:num-format=""><style:list-level-properties text:list-level-position-and-space-mode="label-alignment"><style:list-level-label-alignment text:label-followed-by="listtab" text:list-tab-stop-position="3.048cm" fo:text-indent="-3.048cm" fo:margin-left="3.048cm"/></style:list-level-properties></text:outline-level-style></text:outline-style>
  </office:styles>
  <office:automatic-styles>
  <style:page-layout style:name="pm1">
    <style:page-layout-properties fo:page-width="21cm" fo:page-height="29.7cm" style:print-orientation="portrait" fo:margin-top="2cm" fo:margin-bottom="2cm" fo:margin-left="2cm" fo:margin-right="2cm" style:writing-mode="lr-tb"></style:page-layout-properties>
    <style:header-style></style:header-style>
    <style:footer-style></style:footer-style>
  </style:page-layout>
    <style:style style:name="Size8" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Text_20_body"><style:text-properties fo:font-size="8pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Size10" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Text_20_body"><style:text-properties fo:font-size="10pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Size14" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Text_20_body"><style:text-properties fo:font-size="14pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Size20" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Text_20_body"><style:text-properties fo:font-size="20pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Size28" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Text_20_body"><style:text-properties fo:font-size="28pt"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Sans" style:family="text"><style:text-properties style:font-name="Liberation Sans" fo:font-family="'Liberation Sans'"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Mono" style:family="text"><style:text-properties style:font-name="Liberation Mono" fo:font-family="'Liberation Mono'" fo:font-size="10pt"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Red" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:color="#b00020" fo:font-weight="bold"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Under" style:family="text"><style:text-properties style:text-underline-style="solid" style:text-underline-width="auto" style:text-underline-color="font-color"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Mark" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:background-color="#ffff00"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Sup" style:family="text"><style:text-properties style:text-position="super 58%"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Code" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Standard"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-left="1cm" fo:background-color="#f0f0f0" fo:padding="0.1cm"/><style:text-properties style:font-name="Liberation Mono" fo:font-family="'Liberation Mono'" fo:font-size="9pt"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Right" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Text_20_body"><style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="end"/><style:text-properties style:font-name="Liberation Sans" fo:font-family="'Liberation Sans'" fo:font-style="italic"/></style:style></office:automatic-styles>
  <office:master-styles><style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="pm1"/></office:master-styles>
  <office:body><office:text><text:p text:style-name="Size28">A very large opening line</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Size20">A large subtitle in twenty points</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Each volunteer measured the routes taken by the ferry during storms without <text:span text:style-name="Sans">Each volunteer mapped the weight of the fishing nets after</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="Mono">mono_spaced(code)</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="Red">bold red words</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="Under">underlined phrase</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="Mark">highlighted text</text:span> E = mc<text:span text:style-name="Sup">2</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="Italic">The lighthouse crew estimated the number of lanterns</text:span>. The lighthouse crew catalogued the amount of rain collected in copper gauges while the tide was low. The archive keeper compared the growth of moss on the old stone walls without any modern instruments. The survey team recorded the number of lanterns repaired each winter using only paper notebooks.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Size14">The Brindlemoor committee catalogued the weight of the fishing nets after each trip without any modern instruments. The Brindlemoor committee recorded the growth of moss on the old stone walls according to the old manual. The fictional cooperative questioned the tidal patterns of the northern bay over three consecutive weeks.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Size10">The harbour office measured the tidal patterns of the northern bay according to the old manual. Each volunteer recorded the height of the hedges along the canal according to the old manual. The night shift questioned the height of the hedges along the canal before the season ended. The survey team compared the condition of the wooden pier despite the persistent fog. The lighthouse crew reviewed the tidal patterns of the northern bay with remarkable patience.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Size8">The night shift estimated the colours of the evening sky over the dunes without any modern instruments. The Brindlemoor committee compared the condition of the wooden pier while the tide was low. A small working group mapped the height of the hedges along the canal using only paper notebooks. Every visiting student compared the condition of the wooden pier over three consecutive weeks. Each volunteer summarised the colours of the evening sky over the dunes while the tide was low. The archive keeper described the songs sung at the autumn market in a careful and orderly way. The night shift recorded the routes taken by the ferry during storms using only paper notebooks. The Brindlemoor committee compared the songs sung at the autumn market according to the old manual.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Code">function lanternCount(nights) {</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Code">  return nights * 3 + 1; // fictional</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Code">}</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Right">Signed by the fictional harbour office.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Size14">Each volunteer recorded the routes taken by the ferry during storms over three consecutive weeks. The Brindlemoor committee described the tidal patterns of the northern bay before the season ended. The lighthouse crew measured the tidal patterns of the northern bay while the tide was low. The lighthouse crew questioned the amount of rain collected in copper gauges in a careful and orderly way.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Size20">The harbour office catalogued the colours of the evening sky over the dunes while the tide was low. The night shift questioned the height of the hedges along the canal without any modern instruments.</text:p></office:text></office:body>
</office:document>
